#Main component:-

| Component                     | Responsibility                    |
| ----------------------------- | --------------------------------- |
| `pacing_engine.py`            | Progressive pacing                |
| `predictive_pacing_engine.py` | Predictive pacing                 |
| `safety_controller.py`        | Enforces safety limits            |
| `call_allocator.py`           | Assigns borrowers and agents      |
| `call_manager.py`             | Manages call state                |
| `event_processor.py`          | Processes provider events         |
| `agent_manager.py`            | Manages agent lifecycle           |
| `borrower_manager.py`         | Manages borrower pool             |
| `provider_a.py`               | Mock telecom provider A           |
| `provider_b.py`               | Mock telecom provider B           |
| `persistent_store.py`         | Persistence, locking and recovery |
| `app.py`                      | Streamlit simulator               |

